# Phase 0: Discovery, Architecture & Master Implementation Plan
## Nutrexia D2C E-Commerce Web Application

---

## 1. Project Overview & Requirements Synthesis

The **Nutrexia D2C E-Commerce Web Application** is a responsive Direct-to-Consumer platform built to showcase and sell Nutrexia's climate-smart, millet-based plant protein products. 

This project strictly adheres to two sources of truth:
1. **`Nutrexia_SRS.md`**: Functional & Technical Source of Truth (Architecture, Data Models, Business Rules, API layer, Security, Subscriptions, Admin Panel, Phasing).
2. **`Nutrexia_Template_Claude.html`**: Visual & UI Source of Truth (Color palette, typography, visual hierarchy, layout spacing, interactive components, design language).

---

## 2. Technical Stack & Architecture

### System Architecture
The application follows a production-grade 3-tier monorepo architecture:
- **Frontend App (`apps/web`)**: Next.js 15+ (App Router, React 19, TypeScript), SSR/SSG for public pages, PWA with Web App Manifest and Service Worker caching.
- **Backend API (`apps/api`)**: Node.js REST API with NestJS (TypeScript), serving as the single system of truth for commerce operations, pricing calculations, authentication, Razorpay payment verification, Shiprocket fulfillment, and subscription scheduling.
- **Admin Panel (`apps/admin`)**: Next.js React Dashboard for catalogue management, batch traceability, orders, inventory, customers, coupons, reviews, and CMS content.
- **Shared Packages (`packages/*`)**:
  - `packages/ui`: Shared React design system components extracted from `Nutrexia_Template_Claude.html`.
  - `packages/types`: Shared TypeScript interfaces/types (User, Product, Order, Subscription, etc.).
  - `packages/validation`: Zod schemas for client-side form validation and API DTO validation.
  - `packages/utils`: Shared formatting helpers (INR currency formatting, date helpers, calculations).
- **Database & ORM (`prisma/`)**: PostgreSQL datastore with Prisma ORM for type-safe schema definitions and migrations.

```
nutrexia/
├── apps/
│   ├── web/               # Next.js 15 Storefront + PWA
│   ├── api/               # NestJS Backend API
│   └── admin/             # Next.js Admin Panel
├── packages/
│   ├── ui/                # Shared Nutrexia UI Component Library
│   ├── types/             # Shared TypeScript Interfaces & Enums
│   ├── validation/        # Shared Zod Schemas
│   └── utils/             # Shared Helper Functions & Formatting
├── prisma/
│   └── schema.prisma      # PostgreSQL Schema & Migrations
├── docs/                  # Project specifications & baseline template
├── .env.example           # Centralized environment variable template
├── pnpm-workspace.yaml    # PNPM Monorepo configuration
├── package.json           # Root scripts and workspace config
└── README.md              # Project documentation
```

