10. **`StorySection`**: Navy Commander founder story, awards & incubations badges.
11. **`ClimateImpact`**: Green sustainability banner with carbon reduction metrics.
12. **`TestimonialGrid`**: Verified beta taster reviews.
13. **`FAQAccordion`**: Expandable Q&A accordion.
14. **`NewsletterWaitlist`**: Email capture form for future drop notifications.
15. **`CartDrawer`**: Slide-out cart drawer with dynamic item listing, subtotal calculation, item removal, and checkout CTA.
16. **`ToastNotification` & `SocialProofPopup`**: Micro-interaction notifications for cart updates and real-time purchase activity.

