## 5. Database Schema & Data Modeling (`prisma/schema.prisma`)

The system datastore will model the core domain entities as specified in SRS Section 7:

- **Users & Auth**: `User`, `UserProfile`, `Address`, `RefreshToken`, `AuditLog`.
- **Catalogue & Pricing**: `Product`, `ProductVariant`, `ProductImage`, `Category`.
- **Inventory & Batches**: `Inventory`, `InventoryMovement`, `Batch` (batch number, mfg date, exp date, quantity, lab report/COA reference).
- **Commerce**: `Cart`, `CartItem`, `Order`, `OrderItem`, `OrderAddress`.
- **Payments & Refunds**: `Payment` (Razorpay order ID, payment ID, signature, status), `Refund`.
- **Subscriptions**: `Subscription` (frequency, status, next billing date, address ID), `SubscriptionItem`.
- **Marketing & Engagement**: `Coupon`, `CouponUsage`, `NewsletterSubscriber`, `Wishlist`, `Review`.
- **Content & CMS**: `BlogPost`, `FAQ`, `LabReport`, `Certification`, `HomepageBanner`.

